WEBVTT
NOTE DRAFT captions for an ORIGINAL 42s Zen12 explainer. Do not claim synchronization until final hosted audiovisual media and human captions QA. No media is activated.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
A horse seemed to do math.
The audience could count every hoofbeat.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:12.400
Then an investigator changed one thing:
did the questioner know the answer?

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.800
When no one knew,
the famous performance almost vanished.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:23.500
The lesson is not that our minds cannot be trusted.
It's that a good explanation needs a control.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.700
Zen12 offers a twelve-minute audio routine
and four listening styles.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:35.800
That describes a product, not proof of
an hour's meditation benefits in twelve minutes.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.000
You can try twelve quiet minutes for free first.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
